# Outcome of an in-flight cartesian request (SDK Arm::poll_cart).
#
# pending=true means the firmware has not answered yet. err is the firmware's own
# cartesian error code and is only meaningful when the plan has been reported.


---
bool success
string message
bool pending
bool settled
int32 err
int32 waypoints
uint32 plan_us
float64 settle_err_rad
float64[] q_final
